# Virtual scroll preview UX

**Rule:** Thumbnails and file previews in virtualized lists must **not reset when the user scrolls away and back**, and loading must **continue off-screen**. Never tie preview data to component-local async state alone.

Specs: `.cursor/interface/content-preview-project-view.md` §8.7 · `.cursor/interface/file-preview-item.md` §2.1.

## Why

Virtual scroll (`@tanstack/react-virtual`, windowing) **unmounts** off-screen items. If preview loading lives only in `useEffect` + `useState` with `cancelled = true` on cleanup:

- Completed loads are dropped when the item leaves the viewport
- Remount shows an empty placeholder and may never restart
- User sees thumbnails disappear after scroll — broken UX

A **global invalidation counter** (e.g. `previewGeneration` on every `status.get` or `workdir:changed`) causes the same flicker without scroll: icon flash → reload for every visible cell.

## Required pattern

### Thumbnail cache (`workdirPreviewCache.ts`)

1. **Shared cache** outside React tree — keyed by `repoPath + path` only (no global generation).
2. **Per-path invalidation** — `invalidateWorkdirPreview(repoPath, paths)` when file content changes (`modified` / `size` on soft entries refresh, file restore, rename).
3. **Full clear** — `clearWorkdirPreviewCache()` only on repo switch (`useWorkdirPreview` when `repoPath` changes).
4. **Inflight** — keyed by `repoPath + path`; skip duplicate fetches if cached or already inflight.
5. **Notify subscribers** — `subscribeWorkdirPreview` on cache **write** (load complete, invalidate, clear). Do **not** notify on inflight start (avoids grid-wide `setState`).
6. **LRU** — max 128 entries; eviction revokes `blob:` URLs (scroll through many files may reload off-screen thumbs — expected).

### Hook (`useWorkdirPreview.ts`)

1. **Sync read on mount** — `useLayoutEffect` + `readPreviewSnapshot` from cache on first frame (no icon flash).
2. **Subscribe** to cache changes so remounted items update when a background load finishes.
3. **Do not abort** thumbnail fetch on unmount — cache retains the result.
4. **No dependency** on `workdirGeneration` / `status` — VCS badge updates must not invalidate thumbnails.

### Grid consumer (`FilePreviewItem` / `FilePreviewGrid`)

1. `FilePreviewItem` wrapped in `React.memo`.
2. Stable callbacks from parent (`useCallback` for `vcsStatusFor`, `lockUserFor`, `subtitleFor` in `ProjectPreviewPanel`).
3. Reuse `useWorkdirPreview` — do not invent per-item local loading.

### Workdir refresh (must not flicker Content Preview)

| Signal | Grid entries | Thumbnails | Sidebar tree |
|--------|--------------|------------|--------------|
| `workdir:changed` (debounced) | Soft refresh via `workdirGeneration++` | Keep cache; invalidate only paths with changed `modified`/`size` | **No** `loadProjectData` on every event |
| `setStatus` / polling | `workdirGeneration++` **only** when `committable` changes | Unchanged | Status/locks update only |
| Scope change (folder, Changed toggle) | Hard clear + loading | Unchanged unless path left repo | — |
| Repo switch | Clear entries | `clearWorkdirPreviewCache()` | `loadProjectData` |

`useWorkdirFolderEntries`: on `workdirGeneration` bump alone — **do not** clear `entries` before fetch; call `setEntries` only when `sameDirEntryList` is false (`dirEntries.ts`).

### Anti-flicker invariants (regression — do not break)

**`useWorkdirFolderEntries`**

- `scopeKey` includes `committable` **only when** `showChangedOnly === true`. With Changed OFF, committable updates must **not** hard-reset the grid.
- Hard reset (`clear entries`, `loading=true`) **only** when `scopeKey` changes (folder, Changed toggle, committable set while Changed ON).
- Soft refresh (`workdirGeneration++` alone): keep visible `entries`/`subfolders`; `setLoading(true)` **never**; on API error **do not** clear entries.
- `applyFileEntries` + `sameDirEntryList`: return previous array ref when fingerprint unchanged.

**`ProjectPreviewPanel`**

- Show full-screen «Loading…» **only** when `loading && entries.length === 0 && subfolders.length === 0` (`showEntriesLoading`). Never unmount the grid during background refresh.

**`useProjectStatusPolling`**

- On `workdir:changed`: `refreshStatus()` first; call `bumpWorkdirGeneration()` **only if** `setStatus` did not already bump (committable changed). Avoid double soft refresh.
- **Never** `loadProjectData()` on watcher/poll — only repo open / explicit retry.

**`ContentInfoPanel`**

- `setLoading(true)` on metadata fetch **only** when file path / `metadataKey` / branch changes — **not** on `workdirGeneration` alone (soft metadata refresh keeps current UI visible).


- Do **not** load previews only in `useEffect` → `useState` with cleanup that ignores completed promises
- Do **not** use a global `previewGeneration` (or similar) to invalidate all thumbnails on `status.get` or `workdir:changed`
- Do **not** call `loadProjectData()` on every `workdir:changed` — use `refreshStatus` + `bumpWorkdirGeneration`; reserve full tree load for repo open / explicit retry
- Do **not** assume a mounted component will receive the async result — virtual scroll breaks that assumption
- Do **not** clear visible previews on scroll; only invalidate on real file content changes or repo switch
- Do **not** replace `entries` with a new array when fingerprint is unchanged — causes unnecessary virtualizer re-renders

## Canonical implementation

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/lib/workdirPreviewCache.ts` | Cache, inflight, `invalidateWorkdirPreview`, `clearWorkdirPreviewCache` |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/lib/dirEntries.ts` | `sameDirEntryList`, `changedPreviewPaths` |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/hooks/useWorkdirPreview.ts` | Hook: layout sync + subscription + kick off load |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/hooks/useWorkdirFolderEntries.ts` | Soft/hard entries refresh |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/hooks/useProjectStatusPolling.ts` | Watcher: `refreshStatus` + `bumpWorkdirGeneration` (no `loadProjectData`) |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/components/preview/FilePreviewGrid.tsx` | Virtualized grid consumer |
| `sources/gui/frontend/src/components/preview/FilePreviewItem.tsx` | Per-file thumbnail via `useWorkdirPreview` (`memo`) |

## When adding new virtualized previews

1. Reuse `useWorkdirPreview` / `workdirPreviewCache` — do not invent per-item local loading
2. Test: scroll away while thumbnails load, scroll back — previews must appear without manual refresh
3. Test: scroll through many files — already-loaded thumbnails must stay stable
4. Test: wait on polling / `workdir:changed` — grid must not flash Loading or icon placeholders
